## L0003 -- a number written against a name (2a): Lume has no implicit multiplication.
## command: lume build   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; L0003_digit_glued_to_name.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: write the operator: 2 * a
fn f(a: int, b: int) -> int = 2a + b
print f(1, 2)
